category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Enhanced config file parser, which merges config files placed in several locations into one (utilities)"
ldesc: "libeconf is a highly flexible and configureable library to parse and manage
key=value configuration files. It reads configuration file snippets from
different directories and builds the final configuration file for the
application from it."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/openSUSE/libeconf
license: MIT
